  "editorialSummary": "Nothing captures modern efficiency quite like [Anthropic filing for an IPO](https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/30/anthropic-ipo-s1-revenue-compute.html) alongside a [$6.3 billion Binance crypto heist](https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/oct/29/binance-crypto-exchange-hack) while [French police deploy 70,000 officers](https://www.repubblica.it/esteri/2026/10/30/news/francia_proteste_rischio_disordini_halloween_governo_schiera_70mila_agenti-425687284/?rss) to manage the cost of living. At least researchers testing the [new pancreatic cancer vaccine](https://oglobo.globo.com/saude/noticia/2026/10/30/cancer-de-pancreas-vacina-experimental-ativa-defesas-do-organismo-em-quase-100percent-dos-pacientes.ghtml) are finally finding something that refuses to quit.",
